{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Tentti 是一款把考試倒數、課堂筆記、閃卡與溫習提醒集中管理的工具，適合需要同時應付期中、期末、測驗與專題的學生。目前該 App 終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>兌換中，原價為 US $4.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460bb-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>考試倒數與溫習管理</h2>\n<p>Tentti 可加入期中、期末、測驗、專題、簡報與口試，並以顏色區分課程及顯示剩餘日數。每個考試設有專頁，集中筆記、閃卡與提醒，筆記可連至考試方便溫習。閃卡按 1、3、7、14、30 日重現，答錯會重新開始，複習安排早於考試。另有 15 至 90 分鐘專注計時器、考試前提醒及主畫面小工具，毋須帳戶，資料留在裝置。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-1.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-2.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-3.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-4.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-5.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費兌換終生版</h2>\n<p>Tentti: Exam Countdown 終生版限時免費中，用戶透過兌換連結領取，注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。兌換連結數目有限，額滿即止。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tentti: Exam Countdown</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>兌換位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/redeem/?ctx=offercodes&amp;id=6827769242&amp;code=LOVETENTTI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a> （額滿即止）</li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:53:31.942879+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:27:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:31:07.880262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:47:00.890572+00:00","content_hash":"bdcc717f84ff5d76e7c913e9908f123163cd5828781ac75699d5391dbed7e677","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}